<title>BELGIUM: Trade in Clabecq shares suspended - bourse.</title>
<headline>Trade in Clabecq shares suspended - bourse.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in the shares of Belgian steelmaker Forges de Clabecq was suspended on Thursday morning at the company's request, the Brussels Bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>No reason was given immediately for the request.</p>
<p>The company is due to hold its annual general meeting today.</p>
<p>The firm's shares last traded on Wednesday at 200 francs.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
